{"game": "redfall", "language": "english", "appid": 1294810, "month": "2025-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1759276800, "end_date": 1761955199, "month_true_total": 10, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-09-02 17:06:46 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "207781063", "author": {"steamid": "76561198141317892", "personaname": "Bluechaos_21", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198141317892/", "num_games_owned": 243, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1041, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 399, "deck_playtime_at_review": 42, "last_played": 1762891227, "avatar": "c51213a71ff912f422c60af1a1411d0f630dcf74"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is fine i've played worse and when i played with friends i had fun when it launched and since they added the few updates and patches to improve the game i like it even more now i would give it a 7/10 now \n\n5/10 when first launched", "timestamp_created": 1761649795, "timestamp_updated": 1761649795, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.477175682783126831", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207412703", "author": {"steamid": "76561198151012677", "personaname": "Healy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/healyhealyhealy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 4260, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3787, "last_played": 1762014115, "avatar": "83d2ab083eb76aebed718fd01921fbe2af2b7e35"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've loved this game so far, had no issues at all and the game has been really fun.\nIt's now a completely working game and it's definitely worth playing, it's very unfortunate the terrible release has killed the game because it has so much potential to it and i'd love an expansion/sequel.\n\nAfter completing the game i have to say the final boss fight was a complete let down, i was expecting more from that fight.\n\nStill loved the game and really disappointing we'll never get a sequel as in its current state it's a really solid and fun game.\n\n---\n\nDecided to play it again right away with a different character on eclipse from level 1. The beginning feels super hard but after you rack up the community standing it becomes super easy again, bosses are a lot tougher but still beatable as long as you have up to date weapons, last boss once again was a complete disappointment, by far easiest of them all, i disappointed myself hoping for a secret second phase on eclipse but nope. Since some achieves are coop only and i play solo i've given myself them as i complete the story with them, one day i'll come back to the game and do the others but doing 100% runs both times was enough for me for now. Came across a few crash to desktops on fast travelling this time.\n\nVery enjoyable game.", "timestamp_created": 1761249984, "timestamp_updated": 1761685928, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 14, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.516637265682220459", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207107180", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032110576", "personaname": "PEPSI FAN 45", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/5616464684776741864/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 129, "playtime_forever": 6637, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 256, "last_played": 1780105277, "avatar": "f61a1c2e9ee05236d6cbc89add14976eb05b6cd9"}, "language": "english", "review": "GREAT VAMPIRE KILLING  GAME   KILL VAMPIRES  IS  FUN", "timestamp_