ox they were checking off as you play, and the end product suffered for it.", "timestamp_created": 1760215123, "timestamp_updated": 1760215123, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.451536327600479126", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206183821", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051759776", "personaname": "cade ☆", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tiredcade/", "num_games_owned": 1226, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 1247, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 675, "last_played": 1784495372, "avatar": "64a8b64a1042798a9938d7644bc41396bda145d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "loveeee... gunplay so fun and most of the serious problems have been worked out.\n\nneed more vampire shooters #tbh..", "timestamp_created": 1759923351, "timestamp_updated": 1759923351, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.473308593034744263", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206151420", "author": {"steamid": "76561198103075418", "personaname": "Kvatch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198103075418/", "num_games_owned": 1211, "num_reviews": 291, "playtime_forever": 795, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 795, "last_played": 1787034313, "avatar": "bd162d28bca4a827f0ef7dc55954cea2068f1eac"}, "language": "english", "review": "I just cant its so mind numbing. Maybe I will go back and clear it.\n(edit 18/08/2026)\n7h 54m Played\nThe pain of trying to clear your backlog,\n\nI really didn't enjoy