nt slides which totally remove the player from engagement. The characters are bad, not just the character designs but the fact that they have two specific powers that aren't all that fun to even use. The gameplay itself is incredibly bland, the AI being brainless kind of makes the enemy encounters feel dull almost immediately, it's yet another looter shooter leveled system, and the weapons altogether just aren't interesting. If I will give this game any praise for anything, it's that the only semi-decent thing about the game in its entirety is the world design and asset quality. It feels like the environment artists they put in charge were really good at what they do, it's just a shame that their talents were wasted on this game.", "timestamp_created": 1759640945, "timestamp_updated": 1759640945, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.614949941635131836", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205586666", "author": {"steamid": "76561198847804080", "personaname": "Ballen Patrol", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198847804080/", "num_games_owned": 398, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 1014, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 270, "deck_playtime_at_review": 270, "last_played": 1768952321, "avatar": "671ef235b4467ce2b31d1ac816dacab9adbbc1d4"}, "language": "english", "review": "this is going to sound crazy but its not bad. i mean its not that good ether but if you get it for like 10 bucks then its A very good deal. i don't know man i had a pretty good time for the price i paid. bring a buddy and it gets a little better.just don't go into it expecting a 10/10. go into it expecting a like 6/10 then you will have a better time.", "timestamp_created": 1759284165, "time